{title: 219 - When Jesus Comes in Glory}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #219 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 219}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]When Jesus [Ab]comes [Bbm]in [Gdim]glory,
[Ab]As [Fm]Lord [Gdim]and [Eb]King [Cm]of [Db]kings,
[Eb]O [Cm]what [Ddim]a [Eb]wondrous [Bbm]story
[Gdim]The [Ab]blessed [Gdim]Bible [Fm]brings:
[Ab]His [Fm]face [Eb]will [Fm]shine [Ab]like [Bbm]sunlight,
[Bbm]His [Cm]head be [Bbm]white [Ab]as [Bbm]snow,
[Eb]His eyes [Cm]like [Ab]flaming firelight,
[Ab]His [Fm]feet [Eb]like [Fm]brass [Ab]aglow.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]His [Cm]voice [Ab]like [Fm]rushing [Gdim]waters
[Ab]Will [Fm]reach [Gdim]with [Eb]mighty [Db]sound
[Eb]Into [Ddim]the [Eb]deepest [Bbm]quarters
[Gdim]Of [Ab]all [Gdim]creation [Fm]round;
[Ab]And [Fm]at [Eb]this [Fm]wondrous [Bbm]greeting
[Bbm]The [Cm]dead in [Bbm]Christ [Ab]shall [Bbm]rise,
[Eb]Their [Cm]Lord [Ab]and [Bbm]Savior [Gdim]meeting
[Ab]In [Fm]glory in [Ab]the skies.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]And [Cm]we [Ab]who [Fm]are [Bbm]believing
[Ab]And [Fm]His [Gdim]appearing [Db]love,
[Eb]Shall [Cm]know [Ddim]we [Eb]are receiving
[Gdim]His [Ab]glory [Gdim]from [Fm]above;
[Ab]His [Fm]resurrection [Bbm]power
[Bbm]Will [Cm]raise us [Bbm]to [Ab]the [Bbm]place
[Eb]Where [Cm]we [Ab]that [Bbm]wondrous [Gdim]hour
[Ab]Shall [Fm]see [Eb]Him [Fm]face [Ab]to face.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb]O [Cm]hasten [Fm]Thine [Bbm]appearing,
[Ab]Thou [Fm]bright [Gdim]and [Eb]Morning [Db]Star!
[Eb]Lord, [Cm]may [Ddim]we [Eb]soon be [Bbm]hearing
[Gdim]The [Ab]trumpet [Gdim]sound [Fm]afar;
[Ab]Thy [Fm]people all [Ab]are [Bbm]yearning
[Bbm]To [Cm]be Thy [Bbm]raptured bride,
[Eb]And [Cm]at [Ab]Thine [Bbm]own [Ab]returning
[Ab]Be [Fm]caught [Eb]up [Fm]to [Ab]Thy side.
{end_of_verse}
